{"id":"n67461-6-6","stage":4,"title":"엉키다 · 纠结","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67461-6-6-1","ko":"뭐 좋은 방법 없을까?","zh":"有没有什么好办法？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뭐","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋은","meaning":"方便，好","explanation":"좋다：方便，好；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"13","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"방법","meaning":"方法，办法","explanation":"방법：方法，办法","readings":[{"term":"방법","audio":"/audio/a4a801d526fb251193b0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65531","senseId":"1","lemma":"방법","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없을까?","meaning":"不可以，不能","explanation":"없다：不可以，不能；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"6","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"方便，好","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某事做起来很容易或很便利。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"a4a801d526fb2511","term":"방법","zh":"方法，办法","audio":"/audio/a4a801d526fb251193b0.mp3","entryId":"65531","definition":"处理某事的手段或方式。","pronunciation":["방법"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不可以，不能","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"某事不可能。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/92c80abae421bb887371.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67461-6-6-2","ko":"머릿속에 생각들이 너무 엉켜 있어.","zh":"我脑子里的想法乱成一团了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"머릿속에","meaning":"脑里，心里","explanation":"머릿속：脑里，心里；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"머릿속","audio":"/audio/eedd8e115f4ab5b7cbda.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55373","senseId":"1","lemma":"머릿속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생각들이","meaning":"念头，想法","explanation":"생각：念头，想法；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"3","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"엉켜","meaning":"纠结，纠缠不清","explanation":"엉키다：纠结，纠缠不清；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"엉키다","audio":"/audio/3fb807c2d68c4f52915c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67461","senseId":"6","lemma":"엉키다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"eedd8e115f4ab5b7","term":"머릿속","zh":"脑里，心里","audio":"/audio/eedd8e115f4ab5b7cbda.mp3","entryId":"55373","definition":"脑子里，想法中，心里头。","pronunciation":["머리쏙","머릳쏙"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"念头，想法","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"想做某事的心理或关注；或指那样的事。","pronunciation":["생각"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"3fb807c2d68c4f52","term":"엉키다","zh":"纠结，纠缠不清","audio":"/audio/3fb807c2d68c4f52915c.mp3","entryId":"67461","definition":"感情或想法等变得混乱。","pronunciation":["엉키다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7310a0716f96a548a65e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.453,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67461","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"6","sourceLevel":"고급","day":126,"sequenceScore":2.2797,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["有没有什么好办法？","我脑子里的想法乱成一团了。","还疼得很厉害吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["有没有什么好办法？","我脑子里的想法乱成一团了。","还疼得很厉害吗？"],"answer":1}]}
